    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1610">

                <pb facs="1313" n="1197" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1197"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 819.77/107.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-03-05">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 5, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Dziuk concession has been revoked by the Government of Panama, on the ground
                    of failure to fulfill certain of its terms. See my No. 15 of November 29,
                    1911.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dodge.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
